# L §5.8: "at load: LOAD-UNIT for a value of the wrong type or unit".
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-01-01
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

input a: money PLN

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  a = true
=== expect
refused: LOAD-UNIT ...
